 sources='Regulation (EU) 2017/1129 Arts 1(3), 1(4), 2(d), 2(e), 3, 22 (VR-O-14) as amended by Regulation (EU) 2024/2809 (VR-O-15); Regulation (EU) 2020/1503 (VR-O-16); Directive 2014/65/EU Art. 24(3), Delegated Regulation 2017/565 (VR-O-17); UCPD 2005/29/EC (green claims); national laws per member state (overlay)',
